{\b\fs24 Wallpaper Studio}\par
\par
Animated, video and image wallpapers with playful desktop effects.\par
\par
{\b What gets installed}\par
\bullet  The app, in your user folder (%LocalAppData%\\Programs\\Wallpaper Studio). No administrator rights are needed.\par
\bullet  Start menu and desktop shortcuts.\par
\par
{\b Your data}\par
Wallpapers you add and your settings are kept in %AppData%\\WallpaperStudio. Uninstalling leaves them in place, so a reinstall picks up where you left off.\par
\par
{\b Requirements}\par
Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit) with the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime, which comes with Windows 11.\par
\par
{\b Terms}\par
This software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The desktop effects are purely visual: they never intercept your clicks or keystrokes and collect no data.\par
}
